    "name": "CASCADE",
    "steam_appid": 3749900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASCADE is a stylish first-person roguelite with a focus on blazingly fast movement. Slide from surface to surface, unlock and upgrade abilities and face otherworldly enemies and bosses, all while exploring a corrupted digital space. But don't forget: Always keep on moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The codes have been lost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallowed by digital chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The administration has sent you to retrieve them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You will find much more.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLIDE &amp; SLIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the abstract, corrupted world of an ancient computer system in which a digital space has materialized. Slide on its planes to gain speed and recharge your energy. But be careful with your alignment, you don't want to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip two abilities, one for each hand. Dash, shoot projectiles, use swords, etc. and upgrade your abilities in different ways each run. Building your ability into new specializations for different strategies, evolving them to new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/b2ad4b59101f0a98f888a79268e4ce05.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/b2ad4b59101f0a98f888a79268e4ce05.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/b2ad4b59101f0a98f888a79268e4ce05.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter many different enemies and react accordingly to their varied behaviors, using your abilities. Adjust your strategy depending on your current build. You might want to evade them, rather than attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique First-Person sliding action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different abilities to unlock, with many upgrades for each one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different builds with every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all rooms to advance to the next stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all stages and face the boss to advance to the next world</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASCADE is a stylish first-person roguelite with a focus on blazingly fast movement. Slide from surface to surface, unlock and upgrade abilities and face otherworldly enemies and bosses, all while exploring a corrupted digital space. But don't forget: Always keep on moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The codes have been lost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallowed by digital chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The administration has sent you to retrieve them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You will find much more.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLIDE &amp; SLIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/759f5986026822eb8d178c9f0bfe1b49.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the abstract, corrupted world of an ancient computer system in which a digital space has materialized. Slide on its planes to gain speed and recharge your energy. But be careful with your alignment, you don't want to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.webm?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/5ca883fd9fb8fb48065fa03f100cfcc7.mp4?t=1752335238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip two abilities, one for each hand. Dash, shoot projectiles, use swords, etc. and upgrade your abilities in different ways each run. Building your ability into new specializations for different strategies, evolving them to new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/b2ad4b59101f0a98f888a79268e4ce05.poster.avif?t=1752335238\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/b2ad4b59101f0a98f888a79268e4ce05.webm?t=1752335238\" type